{"payload":{"files":{"BOOST.md":"---\nname: Larger code\nsites: github.com\nmade: Yab recipe\npreview: https://github.com/swiftlang/swift/blob/main/CMakeLists.txt\nchecks:\n  - on /*: some of [data-testid='code-cell'], .blob-code-inner\n  - on /*: some of body\n---\n\nMake source code and diffs on GitHub easier to read.\n","manifest.json":"{\n  \"manifest_version\": 3,\n  \"name\": \"Larger code\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"content_scripts\": [\n    {\n      \"matches\": [\n        \"https://github.com/*\"\n      ],\n      \"css\": [\n        \"page/style.css\"\n      ],\n      \"run_at\": \"document_end\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n","page/style.css":".blob-code, .blob-code-inner, [data-testid='code-cell'] { font-size: 14px !important; line-height: 1.7 !important; }\n#read-only-cursor-text-area { font-size: 14px !important; }\n"},"format":1,"id":"github-readable-code","sites":["github.com"]},"revision":"45e06b53b692bce3736baa5881a893487d625d8b2d25ce0a8c19a32148f5fd0e"}